{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226460","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226460","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422646001:1":{"text":"どうして、アヒルを逃がしちまったんだ！あんなに気を付けろって言ったじゃないか！","source_cn":"你怎么能让鸭子都跑了呢，我、我不是跟你说好几遍要注意吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C17FAD92F61AD28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422646002:1":{"text":"ご、ごめん……本を読んでたら、つい夢中になっちゃって……","source_cn":"对不起，这本书我一不小心就看入迷了，没注意鸭子们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AB47F0886B6A1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422646003:1":{"text":"べ、弁償するから！本当にごめんなさい！","source_cn":"我、我赔你吧，真的太对不起了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98570F72466E87BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422646004:1":{"text":"そういう問題じゃないんだよ。あのアヒルたちは、俺のばあちゃんが飼ってるペットなんだ……","source_cn":"不行啊，这些鸭子是我祖母专门养的，只是带来上山放放风。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC68BA9939E47808F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422646005:1":{"text":"何かあったのか？","source_cn":"出什么事了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE34C83E051767FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422646006:1":{"text":"あっ、ブライアン様！実は――","source_cn":"啊，是布莱恩大人！事情是这样的——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DAC059B18B73A84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422646007:1":{"text":"今日、アヒルたちを連れて山を散歩してたんですけど、途中で急用ができて、彼女に少しの間、見ていてもらったんです。","source_cn":"我今天带鸭子上山来放风，但刚刚有些急事，就托这位小姐帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE337C94FFF9001","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422646008:1":{"text":"けど、私……本に没頭しちゃって、アヒルを繋いでた紐が切れたことに気付かなくて……","source_cn":"结果我沉迷看书，完全没注意到拴着鸭子的绳子断了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x472F574153371C3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422646009:1":{"text":"なんだか静かになったなぁとは思ったんだけど……彼に呼ばれるまで、アヒルたちがいなくなってるなんて思いもしなくて……","source_cn":"只觉得它们嘎嘎嘎了半天，然后安静下来了——结果还是守卫...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00C2D3096EA6B643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422646010:3":{"text":"なるほど。それなら、まだ遠くへは行っていないはずだ。私が方角を確かめるので、あなた方はアヒルたちを連れ戻してくれ。","source_cn":"明白了，鸭子们不会跑得太远，我听一下方向，你们把它赶回来吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6039E46FC4DA6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422646011:1":{"text":"ええ！なんでロンロンたちが！？インドラさんにルナーランドを案内するんじゃないんですか？","source_cn":"咦！什么？不是说好带因度厄游览月影乡吗？！为什么还要我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x334C3755161C785F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1422646011":{"text":"ええ！なんでロンロンたちが！？インドラさんにルナーランドを案内するんじゃないんですか？","source_cn":"咦！什么？不是说好带因度厄游览月影乡吗？！为什么还要我们赶鸭子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x334C3755161C785F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422646012:1":{"text":"ルナーランドでの暮らしと、風語りの日常業務を知ってもらうという、私なりの案内の仕方だ。","source_cn":"这是我的导游方式，让诸位见证月影乡居民的真实生活以及我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC479E60514D3ECE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422646014:1":{"text":"インドラ殿にも説明しておこう。","source_cn":"因度厄先生，这就是我展现的部分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA937AEA0AED9294","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422646015:1":{"text":"風語りである私は、風の音を聞き、エルーナの目を通して、ユグドラシルだけでなく、バドーゾ全域を見張っているのだ。","source_cn":"作为风语者，我聆听风声，并依靠艾洛娜的眼睛观察薄暮丛林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FD02AACCE6EBC0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422646016:1":{"text":"なるほどな。監視に罪人の逮捕、それから騒動の鎮圧。私も同じような仕事をしていた。","source_cn":"唔，我能理解。监控，以及逮捕，平息事件，这也是我之前的工作。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x568CC3A28571CD4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422646017:1":{"text":"……えっと、全然違う気がするんですが。","source_cn":"……不是，你们两个的工作内容完全不同吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF46819D1C85E8529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422646018:1":{"text":"でも本人はそう思ってないみたい。","source_cn":"但是不知道为什么就说到一起去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C2EA6440B0D3E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422646019:0":{"text":"かみ合ってない会話はおいといて、アヒルを連れ戻しに行きましょう……","source_cn":"还是别让他俩再鸡同鸭讲了，我们赶紧去把鸭子赶回来吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A26F8E1692CC61F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1422646020:1":{"text":"ていうか、そもそも、なんでロンロンたちがアヒルを追いかけることになるんだよ……！","source_cn":"所以话说回来，布莱恩的工作也好，因度厄的工作也罢，为什...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3627F70C5A662027","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"これも案内のうちか？","source_cn":"这是导游